  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 402.08 Certified tank installer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 402.08 “Certified tank installer” means an individual who is certified by:\n\n(a) The International Code Council in UST system installation/retrofitting; and\n\n(b) The equipment manufacturer as being qualified in the installation of the manufacturer’s equipment or individual system components.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 402.06) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
